+Each request renews the session for 10 minutes; see `EXPIRY_MINUTES` in
+[`larder/sessions.py`](../../larder/sessions.py). The limit was shortened so members are logged out sooner after
+inactivity.
+
+In March 2024, the limit was raised from 10 to 30 minutes after members packing a pantry order on a slow mobile
+connection were logged out before they confirmed it and lost what they had picked. Support logged 120 tickets
+about it that month; 30 minutes was the shortest limit that ended those tickets.
 
